{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3ba400d142cc97c0a9996e14fd6dc7103a01c34aa1278e088b09fa2826eb5154", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が終わった。\n春香のいい表情が沢山撮れたな！）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄结束了。\n拍到了很多春香很棒的表情呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "b6b756bddd88d523d18ad736a513adce7978308971e5e2a329315c791142cc8c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！　\n今日の撮影、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n今天的拍摄，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f27a3858b3a65d28096eaf87e672d9d5496a7ed792235d820c5ac8e4b67d25ab", "ja": "すごく良かったぞ。なんだか、\nいつもよりリラックスしてるように見えたよ。", "zh": "效果特别好。总觉得你看起来比平时更加放松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "79555d7bd4a1fa1287ec3cd8df9a250f35f9facc4505359b58473a6c6ba4284a", "ja": "それはきっと、このパジャマのおかげですね。\nかわいいだけじゃなくって、着心地もいいんですよ。", "zh": "那一定是多亏了这套睡衣。\n不光可爱，穿起来也很舒服呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "30603262bef06344c28be6cd84a5150a2bb0fbc879ea22ba5267034106997cad", "ja": "だから撮影中も、ほんとにウトウトしちゃった\nくらいで……。えへへ♪", "zh": "所以拍摄的时候也真的差点就睡着了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1005_p", "source_sha256": "876fc4e64fb1f4577aa360ecc87eee88c0875c54af28817cf34852d17a36c44d", "ja": "なるほど。それであんなにいい寝顔だったのか。\nでも、ちょっと心配だな。夜、眠れてないのか？", "zh": "原来如此。难怪你睡着时的表情那么安详。\n不过，我还是有点担心。你晚上没睡好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "425d0aeed6901f6eb7ed9d6f28e1674bffe5d7660e99be676247649f9aedd8d4", "ja": "あ、実は……昨日の夜、\n学校の課題をやってたんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，其实……昨天晚上，\n我在做学校的作业……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "48f67dace46a5790ab359adf439e88396f7268815b10fdee278ff9209133d130", "ja": "わからないところを、チャットアプリで友達に\n相談してたら、話が盛り上がっちゃって。", "zh": "我在聊天应用上向朋友请教不会的地方，结果聊得太起劲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "01271f7946813d3aa192322ce4861fbb9065229d71d60e3b79d16abbcfd6e8ce", "ja": "だから、眠れなかったってわけじゃなくって、\nつい夜更かししちゃったんです。あはは……。", "zh": "所以，并不是因为睡不着才熬夜，而是不小心熬夜了。啊哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6bb9da10f263fbf7af9542d0861abc62a5001fb46b4eb2621ea98dcf6dba654b", "ja": "ならいいけど、\nあまり無理しないようにな。", "zh": "那就好，不过也别太勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "bd498d6c4b627066cd919c1145cbd592d6ed287588df0ab854ac332c372e1cbc", "ja": "はいっ。私も、夜更かしはよくないって、頭では\nわかってるんですけど、友達との時間が楽しくて……。", "zh": "是的。我也知道熬夜不好，虽然明白这个道理，但和朋友相处的时光太开心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cd086aecdd5ce18798a715aae69962fa44f08baa2c0cc847ac6acdb260a6af4a", "ja": "春香らしいな。でも安心したよ。\n仕事が忙しくて、疲れすぎてるのかと思ったから。", "zh": "真是春香的风格呢。不过我放心了。\n还以为是工作太忙、累过头了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "69759fa91ec2ab832f16cd94a17658a7f07d4745ef1b777e12b85582c08caccb", "ja": "あっ、すみません。{$P$}さんに、\n心配かけちゃいましたね……。", "zh": "啊，对不起。让{$P$}先生担心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b37ea1ec1609ebb5404259c70ac4b2bdfebb72f1cd5e3c2b22724f887b558258", "ja": "いや、いいんだ。プロデューサーに心配かけるのも\nアイドルの仕事のうちだよ。", "zh": "没事，不用放在心上。让制作人操心也是\n偶像的工作之一嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "684931f0f44906639586f9983c56c2d1573ff4bccec6bd05551dd92605ba50f0", "ja": "ふふっ、そんな仕事ばっかりだと、困っちゃいますね。\nでも、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "呵呵，要是总是做这种工作，也会让人伤脑筋呢。\n不过，还是谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "1e07b9c4dc4e3f741d2bc7c005958ad4d5a7ca33459e62069a43d4fdf4a03687", "ja": "これからは、夜更かしし過ぎないように\n気をつけますね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "以后我会注意，不再熬夜过头了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f919f9eae4a6daaede5d6a4ffcedf6928b6c35fba1380e7728c019430899cd3c", "ja": "ああ。でも、気分転換も大事だし、春香の思うように\n無理のない範囲で過ごしてくれたら、大丈夫だから。", "zh": "嗯。不过，转换心情也很重要，所以只要按照春香的想法，在力所能及的范围内生活就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0253_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "34f1fe8e13838eba1e9dfa23e1f14b036d2cae33f2fefde4c1918ac35ee35de2", "ja": "はいっ！　友達との時間も大切にして、リフレッシュも\nして、お仕事も……ぜーんぶ、いっぱい頑張りますっ♪", "zh": "好的！和朋友相处的时光也很重要，我会好好放松一下，工作也会……全部都加倍努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
